{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20142","headline":"送郑仆射出节山南 · 孟郊","name":"送郑仆射出节山南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"国老出爲将，红旗入青山。\n再招门下生，结束余病孱。\n自笑骑马丑，强从驱驰间。\n顾顾磨天路，褭褭镜下颜。\n文魄既飞越，宦情唯等闲。\n羡他白面少，多是清朝班。\n惜命非所报，慎行诚独艰。\n悠悠去住心，两说何能删。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20142.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20142","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}